  m_text: "Clashing with a fish starts the catching sequence.  \n\nTo successfully
    catch the fish, you must fill up the catch bar, and if the catch bar depletes,
    the fish escapes!\n\nWhen a fish goes in a direction, you must HOLD the button(s)
    of the opposite direction to tire the fish out. Holding none or any other buttons
    will make the meter go down. "
